# Local environment variables for @atl-transit/web.
#
# This .env.example is COMMITTED as documentation of which variables exist.
# Put REAL values in `.env.local` (gitignored) locally, and in Vercel's
# Environment Variables (Settings -> Environment Variables) for prod/preview.
# Never commit real secret values, and never put a secret in the client bundle.

# MARTA real-time rail (RTT) API key.
# Register (free) at: https://www.itsmarta.com/developer-reg-rtt.aspx
#
# SERVER-ONLY. Read via process.env in packages/web/api/** only.
# Do NOT prefix with VITE_ (Vite exposes VITE_* vars to the client bundle),
# and do NOT import it from packages/web/src/** (that ships it publicly).
MARTA_RAIL_API_KEY=
